        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/aba87335330e389199855f0c11d01c06.avif?t=1759566435\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【游戏简介】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >本游戏以《露娜传》人物为主角，构建了一个庞大的平行世界幻想故事，可以看做是《露娜传》的精神续作。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >一群童年时期的小伙伴，偶然的一次经历，前往鬼屋探险，却意外揭开了神秘的封印，导致未知力量蔓延整个世界！数年以后，这群少年已经变得与童年判若两人，为了消灭肆虐全世界的暗黑军团，在命运的引导下，开始了奇妙的冒险之旅。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >然而，这群被烙印灰烬纹章的少年，以所谓的正义的名义对全世界展开了讨伐。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >最终是拯救世界？还是将世界化为灰烬！？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【游戏特色】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >①收录众多高清人物写真，同时伴有数百张神态各异的人物肖像。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏画面丰富多彩，特色十足！内含大量美少女、帅哥写真！萝莉型、御姐型、性感型、魔物型……绅士们的最爱！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/5e7ecc05fc50a2422d5a222c5f54b098.avif?t=1759566435\" width=540 height=412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >②知名声优倾情配音，主要角色均有专属CV。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >无论是普通技能，还是炫酷的必杀技都有专属声优激情配音演绎！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >加上精选的各种好听的BGM，主题曲，濒危时还会改变BGM，战斗临场感拉满！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >经典回合制RPG游戏！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/f9ed2801d2bde98b008c0ba88a57a768.avif?t=1759566435\" width=542 height=412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/2f246c60c079c562d84c6599b30c9b3c.avif?t=1759566435\" width=544 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >③庞大的世界观。走遍整个世界的地图容量，村镇、迷宫、场景极为丰富！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >遇敌率不高，且100%逃跑率！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >迷宫不多，且经过合理优化简单好走！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >丰富的天气特效，配合环环相扣的剧情，沉浸感拉满！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/8fbf6daea9ed5a6d299f340471404351.avif?t=1759566435\" width=540 height=392 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >④简单爽快的战斗系统。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >可选一键自动战斗，丰富击杀特效。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >各类动态敌人，炫酷魔法、强力奥义、终极合体技。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >大量必杀技CG动画，配合声优激情演绎，战斗爽快感爆棚！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >不仅是主角们，敌人也会使用各类炫酷必杀技哦！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/ddb84393bac38257d77f4078051c8cba.avif?t=1759566435\" width=534 height=474 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/81d143a0bcb9aaeb53dbce0ff5daa8e2.avif?t=1759566435\" width=532 height=476 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⑤全新的怪物图鉴系统。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >分类了各种敌人，普通敌人，精英敌人，BOSS敌人……，想看谁的资料都能快速进行查找。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >全新的辨识度系统，让敌人的资料一览无余。只要打败敌人的次数越多，它的资料就越发清晰明朗。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >大部分敌人拥有不同的形态，在战斗中达到某些条件他们就会变身，同时属性和携带宝物也会随之变化！各类BOSS每位都拥有超过数种形态，在战场上更加变化多端。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/6129c17c85f6833cf7d6a9e68cbe6b75.avif?t=1759566435\" width=540 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/1cd2dd114e795493047292a7fb1ff20a.avif?t=1759566435\" width=540 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⑥全新的游戏玩法，体验驾驶战车的乐趣。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏中根据剧情，会提供不同种类的战车供玩家驾驶体验！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >是使用主炮或者S-E狠狠地轰炸敌人？还是下车进行白兵战？您可以根据战场随时做出决定！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/6012ee293e3c80000f234c7786573b0f.avif?t=1759566435\" width=540 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/7277214845d839e2abbe5b2a0b26dbb8.avif?t=1759566435\" width=542 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⑦大量的CG动画，精美图片贯穿游戏始终。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >配合引人入胜的剧情，各种反转，各种出人意料的情节。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >让您的游戏体验与观感丰富多彩，沉浸其中。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/122adbe47b40825bc7f723f9b97432ca.avif?t=1759566435\" width=542 height=412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⑧丰富的成就系统，多达上百条各类成就。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >有的随剧情获得，有的根据您的游戏表现获得，还有的靠您发现隐藏的秘密才能获得……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/8775535fceb1be17e1757de07135d4af.avif?t=1759566435\" width=542 height=416 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⑨引人入胜的武器升级系统！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >通过普通战斗获得的资源，玩家可以随时进入神秘空间升级武器，让属性和战斗力大大加强！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >多达上百把属性各异的武器供您升级！每个角色都有专属的不同武器！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >升级不但可以提升属性，还有可能获得额外附加属性，甚至可以学会专属技能！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >升级资源非常容易爆出，并且还可以挂机获得！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >您甚至还可以将数把高级武器合成一把终极武器！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/5a010666921c619867f2e1bbd7e5f9d5.avif?t=1759566435\" width=540 height=412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/afdf2a29107b1556a9e4573e0624deb3.avif?t=1759566435\" width=542 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⑩丰富的武器和首饰装备，让RPG战斗充满各种各种的玩法和乐趣。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >上百种武器搭配各类属性功能不同的首饰，同时配合人物的属性，技能的特点，每个人都可以搭配出适合自己的玩法！再加上战斗中随时更换装备的功能，让战斗充满各式各样的打法和乐趣！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/119483b9fbae8afb41da10e81d20640e.avif?t=1759566435\" width=540 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/2bb0a02b715a85a4845dcd3864faca0c.avif?t=1759566435\" width=541 height=415 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >此外，游戏还内置了任务提示系统。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >任何时候，屏幕上方都会随着剧情的发展，提示您现在该去做什么。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >无须任何攻略，只要看看任务提示，一目了然。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >当然，同艾露比工作室以往的游戏一样，您依然可以通过进入Steam游戏库，点击[手册]查看攻略！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/a3173fee2dbd9cde920caf70f675864e.avif?t=1759566435\" width=542 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【经过反复测试的游戏】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏在制作时尽力优化，几乎没有卡顿！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >只要您的电脑符合推荐的最低配置以上，基本都可以全程流畅地运行游戏！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【艾露比工作室的制作理念】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >我一直在努力探寻既能让传统RPG老玩家回味经典，</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >又能适应现在游戏的节奏和方式，让现代RPG爱好者易于接受的各种游戏设定。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏有着传统RPG的韵味，又尽量融合现代RPG的便利设置。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >希望这款游戏能够带给你一些感动和快乐！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >回味传统RPG经典！快来加入《灰烬军团 命运协奏曲》的世界吧！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/dba884a1774abd351a8f1e45258ab107.avif?t=1759566435\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【作者的话】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >艾露比工作室的游戏，都是带着曾经的童年回忆，去怀旧、去做细节的用心之作。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >不搞好评换礼包，也不搞中途收费，更没有需要另外花钱购买某某道具，才能继续游戏的套路。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在发售前都经过无数次反复测试，发售后只要有问题我会积极更新，只为给玩家最好的游戏体验。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >希望大家能多多支持，有问题请您善意提出，我将会在第一时间更新修复。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/aba87335330e389199855f0c11d01c06.avif?t=1759566435\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【游戏简介】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >本游戏以《露娜传》人物为主角，构建了一个庞大的平行世界幻想故事，可以看做是《露娜传》的精神续作。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >一群童年时期的小伙伴，偶然的一次经历，前往鬼屋探险，却意外揭开了神秘的封印，导致未知力量蔓延整个世界！数年以后，这群少年已经变得与童年判若两人，为了消灭肆虐全世界的暗黑军团，在命运的引导下，开始了奇妙的冒险之旅。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >然而，这群被烙印灰烬纹章的少年，以所谓的正义的名义对全世界展开了讨伐。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >最终是拯救世界？还是将世界化为灰烬！？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【游戏特色】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >①收录众多高清人物写真，同时伴有数百张神态各异的人物肖像。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏画面丰富多彩，特色十足！内含大量美少女、帅哥写真！萝莉型、御姐型、性感型、魔物型……绅士们的最爱！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/5e7ecc05fc50a2422d5a222c5f54b098.avif?t=1759566435\" width=540 height=412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >②知名声优倾情配音，主要角色均有专属CV。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >无论是普通技能，还是炫酷的必杀技都有专属声优激情配音演绎！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >加上精选的各种好听的BGM，主题曲，濒危时还会改变BGM，战斗临场感拉满！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >经典回合制RPG游戏！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/f9ed2801d2bde98b008c0ba88a57a768.avif?t=1759566435\" width=542 height=412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/2f246c60c079c562d84c6599b30c9b3c.avif?t=1759566435\" width=544 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >③庞大的世界观。走遍整个世界的地图容量，村镇、迷宫、场景极为丰富！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >遇敌率不高，且100%逃跑率！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >迷宫不多，且经过合理优化简单好走！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >丰富的天气特效，配合环环相扣的剧情，沉浸感拉满！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/8fbf6daea9ed5a6d299f340471404351.avif?t=1759566435\" width=540 height=392 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >④简单爽快的战斗系统。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >可选一键自动战斗，丰富击杀特效。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >各类动态敌人，炫酷魔法、强力奥义、终极合体技。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >大量必杀技CG动画，配合声优激情演绎，战斗爽快感爆棚！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >不仅是主角们，敌人也会使用各类炫酷必杀技哦！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/ddb84393bac38257d77f4078051c8cba.avif?t=1759566435\" width=534 height=474 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/81d143a0bcb9aaeb53dbce0ff5daa8e2.avif?t=1759566435\" width=532 height=476 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⑤全新的怪物图鉴系统。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >分类了各种敌人，普通敌人，精英敌人，BOSS敌人……，想看谁的资料都能快速进行查找。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >全新的辨识度系统，让敌人的资料一览无余。只要打败敌人的次数越多，它的资料就越发清晰明朗。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >大部分敌人拥有不同的形态，在战斗中达到某些条件他们就会变身，同时属性和携带宝物也会随之变化！各类BOSS每位都拥有超过数种形态，在战场上更加变化多端。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/6129c17c85f6833cf7d6a9e68cbe6b75.avif?t=1759566435\" width=540 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/1cd2dd114e795493047292a7fb1ff20a.avif?t=1759566435\" width=540 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⑥全新的游戏玩法，体验驾驶战车的乐趣。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏中根据剧情，会提供不同种类的战车供玩家驾驶体验！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >是使用主炮或者S-E狠狠地轰炸敌人？还是下车进行白兵战？您可以根据战场随时做出决定！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/6012ee293e3c80000f234c7786573b0f.avif?t=1759566435\" width=540 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/7277214845d839e2abbe5b2a0b26dbb8.avif?t=1759566435\" width=542 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⑦大量的CG动画，精美图片贯穿游戏始终。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >配合引人入胜的剧情，各种反转，各种出人意料的情节。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >让您的游戏体验与观感丰富多彩，沉浸其中。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/122adbe47b40825bc7f723f9b97432ca.avif?t=1759566435\" width=542 height=412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⑧丰富的成就系统，多达上百条各类成就。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >有的随剧情获得，有的根据您的游戏表现获得，还有的靠您发现隐藏的秘密才能获得……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/8775535fceb1be17e1757de07135d4af.avif?t=1759566435\" width=542 height=416 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⑨引人入胜的武器升级系统！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >通过普通战斗获得的资源，玩家可以随时进入神秘空间升级武器，让属性和战斗力大大加强！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >多达上百把属性各异的武器供您升级！每个角色都有专属的不同武器！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >升级不但可以提升属性，还有可能获得额外附加属性，甚至可以学会专属技能！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >升级资源非常容易爆出，并且还可以挂机获得！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >您甚至还可以将数把高级武器合成一把终极武器！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/5a010666921c619867f2e1bbd7e5f9d5.avif?t=1759566435\" width=540 height=412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/afdf2a29107b1556a9e4573e0624deb3.avif?t=1759566435\" width=542 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⑩丰富的武器和首饰装备，让RPG战斗充满各种各种的玩法和乐趣。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >上百种武器搭配各类属性功能不同的首饰，同时配合人物的属性，技能的特点，每个人都可以搭配出适合自己的玩法！再加上战斗中随时更换装备的功能，让战斗充满各式各样的打法和乐趣！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/119483b9fbae8afb41da10e81d20640e.avif?t=1759566435\" width=540 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/2bb0a02b715a85a4845dcd3864faca0c.avif?t=1759566435\" width=541 height=415 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >此外，游戏还内置了任务提示系统。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >任何时候，屏幕上方都会随着剧情的发展，提示您现在该去做什么。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >无须任何攻略，只要看看任务提示，一目了然。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >当然，同艾露比工作室以往的游戏一样，您依然可以通过进入Steam游戏库，点击[手册]查看攻略！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/a3173fee2dbd9cde920caf70f675864e.avif?t=1759566435\" width=542 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【经过反复测试的游戏】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏在制作时尽力优化，几乎没有卡顿！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >只要您的电脑符合推荐的最低配置以上，基本都可以全程流畅地运行游戏！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【艾露比工作室的制作理念】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >我一直在努力探寻既能让传统RPG老玩家回味经典，</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >又能适应现在游戏的节奏和方式，让现代RPG爱好者易于接受的各种游戏设定。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏有着传统RPG的韵味，又尽量融合现代RPG的便利设置。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >希望这款游戏能够带给你一些感动和快乐！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >回味传统RPG经典！快来加入《灰烬军团 命运协奏曲》的世界吧！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795110/extras/dba884a1774abd351a8f1e45258ab107.avif?t=1759566435\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【作者的话】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >艾露比工作室的游戏，都是带着曾经的童年回忆，去怀旧、去做细节的用心之作。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >不搞好评换礼包，也不搞中途收费，更没有需要另外花钱购买某某道具，才能继续游戏的套路。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在发售前都经过无数次反复测试，发售后只要有问题我会积极更新，只为给玩家最好的游戏体验。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >希望大家能多多支持，有问题请您善意提出，我将会在第一时间更新修复。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "A turn based RPG game!Players will follow the plot to encounter various events, defeat various bosses, explore different worlds, and welcome friends who love traditional RPGs to play!",
